<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Streaming por R$ 19,90</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Streaming por apenas R$ 19,90. Teste de 6 horas. Entre no grupo do WhatsApp para saber mais." />
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #090909;
      color: #fff;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 48px 20px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(255,0,0,.25), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(180,0,0,.25), transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(145deg, #090909, #180000 55%, #090909);
    }
    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1050px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border: 1px solid #ff2a2a;
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: #ff4a4a;
      background: rgba(255,0,0,.08);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(38px, 8vw, 76px);
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    h1 span { color: #ff1f1f; }
    .subtitle {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      color: #d8d8d8;
      font-size: clamp(18px, 3vw, 24px);
    }
    .price-box {
      display: inline-flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 24px 34px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .price-label { color: #bbb; font-size: 15px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .price {
      font-size: 54px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #ff2626;
      letter-spacing: -2px;
    }
    .price small {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #fff;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }
    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 0 auto 34px;
    }
    .feature {
      background: #121212;
      border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px 14px;
    }
    .feature strong {
      display: block;
      color: #ff3b3b;
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .feature span { color: #c8c8c8; font-size: 14px; }
    .cta {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: min(100%, 540px);
      padding: 20px 28px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: white;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #d90000, #ff2727);
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 35px rgba(255,0,0,.25);
      transition: .2s ease;
    }
    .cta:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); filter: brightness(1.08); }
    .note {
      margin-top: 14px;
      color: #8f8f8f;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid #222;
      background: #070707;
      padding: 25px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #777;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .hero { padding: 32px 16px; }
      .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .price { font-size: 46px; }
      .cta { font-size: 17px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="badge">OFERTA ESPECIAL</div>

      <h1>STREAMING POR <span>R$ 19,90</span></h1>

      <p class="subtitle">
        Entre agora e conheça nosso serviço de streaming com teste de 6 horas.
        Acesso pensado para diferentes dispositivos e para você assistir onde estiver.
      </p>

      <div class="price-box">
        <span class="price-label">Plano mensal</span>
        <div class="price">R$ 19,90 <small>/ mês</small></div>
      </div>

      <section class="features">
        <div class="feature">
          <strong>TESTE DE 6 HORAS</strong>
          <span>Experimente antes de contratar.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <strong>ACESSO PRÁTICO</strong>
          <span>Use em dispositivos compatíveis com o serviço.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <strong>ATENDIMENTO PELO WHATSAPP</strong>
          <span>Entre no grupo e receba as informações.</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <a class="cta"
         href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/BGSwRc0KDbjCHmR7iPhC8H"
         target="_blank"
         rel="noopener noreferrer">
        ENTRAR NO GRUPO DO WHATSAPP
      </a>

      <p class="note">Ao clicar, você será direcionado diretamente para o grupo do WhatsApp.</p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Streaming. Todos os direitos reservados.
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
